{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%@ is installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ ist installiert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is not installed yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ ist noch nicht installiert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI enrichment modes (Clean, Email, Slack …) use the Codex CLI with your ChatGPT login. This is optional — you can skip it now and connect later in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KI-Modi (Bereinigen, E-Mail, Slack …) nutzen die Codex-CLI mit deinem ChatGPT-Login. Das ist optional – du kannst es jetzt überspringen und später in den Einstellungen verbinden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bedienungshilfen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent Chats run the Claude Code command line tool. This is optional — you can skip it now and install it later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent Chats nutzen das Kommandozeilen-Tool Claude Code. Das ist optional – du kannst es jetzt überspringen und später installieren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All permissions granted!": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alle Berechtigungen erteilt!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All set!": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles bereit!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Permissions": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App-Berechtigungen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-detect": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatisch erkennen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-paste or clipboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatisch einfügen oder in die Zwischenablage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-paste text": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text automatisch einfügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-paste text into other apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text automatisch in andere Apps einfügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zurück"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abbrechen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chats run the real Claude Code CLI. If you prefer Anthropic's own installer, follow the official instructions and then check again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chats nutzen die echte Claude-Code-CLI. Wenn du den Installer von Anthropic bevorzugst, folge der offiziellen Anleitung und prüfe danach erneut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erneut prüfen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click Save Key to store it in your Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klicke auf „Key speichern“, um ihn im Schlüsselbund abzulegen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click each button to grant permission": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klicke jeden Button, um die Berechtigung zu erteilen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schließen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Configuration": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konfiguration"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Configure Hotkey": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tastenkürzel festlegen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect Codex (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex verbinden (optional)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue Setup…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Setup fortsetzen …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't save the key to the macOS Keychain. Unlock your Keychain and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Key konnte nicht im macOS-Schlüsselbund gespeichert werden. Entsperre den Schlüsselbund und versuche es erneut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fertig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get %@ API key →": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@-API-Key holen →"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get Homebrew": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew holen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grant": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erlauben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew is not installed on this Mac. Install Homebrew first, or follow the official instructions for %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew ist auf diesem Mac nicht installiert. Installiere zuerst Homebrew oder folge der offiziellen Anleitung für %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hotkey configured!": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tastenkürzel festgelegt!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How will you use WhisperM8?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wie möchtest du WhisperM8 nutzen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installieren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install %@?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ installieren?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install with Homebrew…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit Homebrew installieren …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ wird installiert …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microphone": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mikrofon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microphone access is restricted on this Mac (for example by a profile or Screen Time). Ask your administrator or change it in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Mikrofonzugriff ist auf diesem Mac eingeschränkt (z. B. durch ein Profil oder Bildschirmzeit). Frage deinen Administrator oder ändere es in den Systemeinstellungen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microphone access was denied. Turn on WhisperM8 under Privacy & Security → Microphone, then come back here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Mikrofonzugriff wurde abgelehnt. Aktiviere WhisperM8 unter Datenschutz & Sicherheit → Mikrofon und komm dann hierher zurück."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Model": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modell"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Native macOS dictation app with best-in-class transcription.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Native macOS-Diktier-App mit erstklassiger Transkription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weiter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next time you start a chat, Claude Code opens here and walks you through signing in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beim nächsten Chat öffnet sich Claude Code hier und führt dich durch die Anmeldung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No agent chat": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kein Agent Chat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No chat selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kein Chat ausgewählt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No project found": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kein Projekt gefunden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No projects yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch keine Projekte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Official instructions": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Offizielle Anleitung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open System Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Systemeinstellungen öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press hotkey to start/stop recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tastenkürzel drücken, um die Aufnahme zu starten oder zu stoppen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press once to start recording, press again to stop and transcribe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einmal drücken startet die Aufnahme, nochmal drücken stoppt und transkribiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Price: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preis: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Provider": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anbieter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Real-time audio feedback": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio-Rückmeldung in Echtzeit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recommended: Control + Shift + Space": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Empfohlen: Control + Shift + Leertaste"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Record your voice for transcription": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Stimme für die Transkription aufnehmen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recording...": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aufnahme läuft …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Replace Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Key ersetzen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Replace Saved Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gespeicherten Key ersetzen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Result:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ergebnis:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Key speichern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up Claude Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code einrichten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Setup incomplete: no API key": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Setup unvollständig: kein API-Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Setup incomplete: no hotkey": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Setup unvollständig: kein Tastenkürzel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Setup incomplete: permissions missing": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Setup unvollständig: Berechtigungen fehlen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in with your ChatGPT account under Settings → AI Output.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Melde dich unter Einstellungen → KI-Ausgabe mit deinem ChatGPT-Konto an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spoken language": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gesprochene Sprache"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Chat": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chat starten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Status"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test your configuration now. Press your hotkey to start, speak, then press again to stop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Teste jetzt deine Konfiguration. Drücke dein Tastenkürzel zum Starten, sprich und drücke erneut zum Stoppen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test your setup": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Teste dein Setup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text will be automatically pasted": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text wird automatisch eingefügt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text will only be copied to clipboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text wird nur in die Zwischenablage kopiert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first time you start a chat, Claude Code opens right inside WhisperM8 and walks you through signing in with your Claude account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beim ersten Chat öffnet sich Claude Code direkt in WhisperM8 und führt dich durch die Anmeldung mit deinem Claude-Konto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installation failed without any output.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Installation ist ohne Ausgabe fehlgeschlagen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installation finished, but the command was not found afterwards. Restart WhisperM8 and check again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Installation ist abgeschlossen, der Befehl wurde danach aber nicht gefunden. Starte WhisperM8 neu und prüfe erneut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installation took too long and was stopped. Try again or use the official instructions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Installation hat zu lange gedauert und wurde gestoppt. Versuche es erneut oder nutze die offizielle Anleitung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The test dictation failed. Check your API key and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Testdiktat ist fehlgeschlagen. Prüfe deinen API-Key und versuche es erneut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcribing...": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transkribiere …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to WhisperM8": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Willkommen bei WhisperM8"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which language do you dictate in?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In welcher Sprache diktierst du?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whisper transcribes best when it knows the language. We preselected the language of your Mac. You can change this later in Settings → Transcription.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whisper transkribiert am besten, wenn es die Sprache kennt. Wir haben die Sprache deines Macs vorausgewählt. Du kannst sie später unter Einstellungen → Transkription ändern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WhisperM8 needs two permissions to work properly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WhisperM8 braucht zwei Berechtigungen, um richtig zu funktionieren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WhisperM8 will run “%@” with Homebrew. Nothing else is changed on your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WhisperM8 führt „%@“ mit Homebrew aus. Sonst wird auf deinem Mac nichts verändert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change this later in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du kannst das später in den Einstellungen ändern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can continue without connecting — without Codex, only Raw dictation runs; enrichment modes fall back to Raw.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du kannst auch ohne Verbindung fortfahren – ohne Codex läuft nur das reine Diktat; KI-Modi fallen auf Raw zurück."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You haven't tested dictation yet. You can finish now, but we recommend a quick test first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast das Diktat noch nicht getestet. Du kannst jetzt abschließen, wir empfehlen aber vorher einen kurzen Test."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your hotkey: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Tastenkürzel: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
